stand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drying"},{"text":"Freezing"},{"text":"Refrigeration"},{"text":"Pasteurization"},{"text":"Sterilization"},{"text":"Evaporation"},{"text":"Baking"},{"text":"Frying"},{"text":"Fermentation"},{"text":"Extrusion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Initial Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Food Packaging Failure Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare packaging failures such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Moisture ingress"},{"text":"Oxygen exposure"},{"text":"Seal failure"},{"text":"Product leakage"},{"text":"Crushing"},{"text":"Loss of texture"},{"text":"Light-induced deterioration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Packaging Science"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the specialization becomes important."},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging Materials"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Plastics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PE"},{"text":"PP"},{"text":"PET"},{"text":"PVC"},{"text":"PS"},{"text":"EVOH"},{"text":"Nylon"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanical properties"},{"text":"Thermal properties"},{"text":"Barrier properties"},{"text":"Compatibility"},{"text":"Food-contact considerations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Paper & Paperboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cartons"},{"text":"Corrugated packaging"},{"text":"Folding cartons"},{"text":"Paper coatings"},{"text":"Barrier coatings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Glass"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Glass bottles"},{"text":"Jars"},{"text":"Chemical resistance"},{"text":"Thermal resistance"},{"text":"Light protection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Metals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aluminium"},{"text":"Tinplate"},{"text":"Cans"},{"text":"Foils"},{"text":"Metal containers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging Structures"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mono-material packaging"},{"text":"Multilayer films"},{"text":"Laminates"},{"text":"Flexible packaging"},{"text":"Rigid packaging"},{"text":"Semi-rigid packaging"},{"text":"Retort packaging"},{"text":"Vacuum packaging"},{"text":"Modified-atmosphere packaging"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn why a particular packaging structure is selected based on:"},{"type":"p","text":"Food Characteristics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Shelf-Life Requirement"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Barrier Requirement"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Processing Conditions"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Distribution Environment"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sustainability","Packaging Structure"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Packaging Properties"},{"type":"p","text":"A packaging technologist must understand how packaging behaves under real conditions."},{"type":"h","text":"Barrier Properties"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Oxygen transmission rate"},{"text":"Water-vapor transmission rate"},{"text":"Carbon dioxide transmission"},{"text":"Aroma barrier"},{"text":"Light barrier"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how these affect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Oxidation"},{"text":"Moisture loss"},{"text":"Moisture absorption"},{"text":"Rancidity"},{"text":"Texture"},{"text":"Flavor"},{"text":"Shelf life"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mechanical Properties"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn testing concepts for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tensile strength"},{"text":"Elongation"},{"text":"Puncture resistance"},{"text":"Tear strength"},{"text":"Burst strength"},{"text":"Compression strength"},{"text":"Impact resistance"},{"text":"Drop resistance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Thermal Properties"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heat sealing"},{"text":"Seal strength"},{"text":"Melting behavior"},{"text":"Thermal resistance"},{"text":"Heat-shrink packaging"},{"text":"Retort conditions"},{"text":"Freezing conditions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Food–Package Interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important areas for a food packaging professional."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Migration"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Packaging component migration"},{"text":"Food-contact materials"},{"text":"Overall migration"},{"text":"Specific migration"},{"text":"Packaging-food compatibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product Interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Absorption"},{"text":"Adsorption"},{"text":"Aroma scalping"},{"text":"Moisture transfer"},{"text":"Oxygen transfer"},{"text":"Chemical interaction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Shelf-Life"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand relationships between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Packaging Barrier","Environmental Exposure","Food Chemical/Microbial Changes","Quality Degradation","Shelf Life"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Packaging Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to design packaging around the product."},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product characteristics"},{"text":"Package dimensions"},{"text":"Material selection"},{"text":"Barrier requirements"},{"text":"Filling method"},{"text":"Sealing method"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Storage conditions"},{"text":"Consumer handling"},{"text":"Shelf life"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Sustainability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Packaging Development Process"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Requirement","Packaging Specification","Material Selection","Prototype","Laboratory Testing","Food Compatibility Testing","Shelf-Life Study","Pilot Trial","Packaging Line Trial","Validation","Commercialization"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Packaging Machinery"},{"type":"p","text":"A packaging technologist should understand the production environment."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list",