 — Sustainable Packaging"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern packaging roles increasingly require sustainability knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recyclability"},{"text":"Reusability"},{"text":"Material reduction"},{"text":"Lightweighting"},{"text":"Mono-material structures"},{"text":"Bio-based materials"},{"text":"Compostable materials"},{"text":"Recycled content"},{"text":"Life-cycle assessment"},{"text":"Packaging waste"},{"text":"Circular economy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the trade-off:"},{"type":"p","text":"Product Protection"},{"type":"p","text":"↕"},{"type":"p","text":"Shelf Life"},{"type":"p","text":"↕"},{"type":"p","text":"Material Use"},{"type":"p","text":"↕"},{"type":"p","text":"Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"↕"},{"type":"p","text":"Recyclability"},{"type":"p","text":"↕"},{"type":"p","text":"Carbon Footprint"},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not simply to use \"less plastic\"; the packaging must still protect the food and maintain safety and shelf life."},{"type":"h","text":"Data & Digital Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern packaging technologist should be comfortable with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Specification sheets"},{"text":"Test data"},{"text":"Statistical calculations"},{"text":"Cost analysis"},{"text":"Supplier comparisons"},{"text":"Trial reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python — Optional but Valuable"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shelf-life data analysis"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Packaging-test datasets"},{"text":"Failure analysis"},{"text":"Process optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CAD"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn one suitable tool for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Packaging dimensions"},{"text":"Structural concepts"},{"text":"Prototype development"},{"text":"Basic 3D packaging visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"}]},{"heading":"Shelf-Life Optimization Through Packaging Selecti